Rule 4 (x and y must have the same number of dimensions)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) = ndim(y)
>>
Rule 5 (shape of x and y must be the same)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) = ndim(y) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i)
