>>
Rule 19 (at least one of the tensors should have positive dimensions if not scalar)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) = 0 ∨ ndim(y) = 0) ∨ (∃i ∈ [0, (if ndim(x) > ndim(y) then ndim(x) else ndim(y)) - 1]: (if i < ndim(x) then shape(x, i) > 0 else false) ∨ (if i < ndim(y) then shape(y, i) > 0 else false))
